    "Many diners do not know the expected tip percentage at a given restaurant.",
    "Tipping norms vary by region, cuisine, service style, and price point.",
    "Customers often feel awkward, rushed, or uncertain when paying their bill.",
    "Restaurants lose a chance to set clear service expectations and reduce payment friction."
