    "A simple app that displays the average tip size for each restaurant.",
    "Benchmarks are calculated from anonymous tip data, local norms, and restaurant category.",
    "Users can quickly see a recommended tip range, such as 15%, 18%, or 20%, before or during checkout.",
    "The app positions itself as a lightweight, privacy-friendly decision tool, not a social review platform."
  ],
  "product_features": {
    "core_features": [
      "Average tip percentage per restaurant",
      "Recommended tip range based on check size and service category",
      "Quick lookup by restaurant name or map location",
      "In-bill sharing or display feature for restaurants",
      "Historical tip trend by day, time, and table type"
    ],
    "differentiators": [
      "Focused exclusively on tip intelligence",
      "Low-friction user experience",
      "Privacy-first data collection",
      "Utility for both customers and restaurant operators"
